<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Create Drive — PulseReach</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css?v=8"></head><body class="app simple-app"><main class="form-shell"><div class="form-top"><a class="brand" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-mark"><img src="/images/pulsereach-logo.png" alt="PulseReach logo"></span> PulseReach</a><span class="signed-in">Signed in as <b><%= organizer.name %></b></span></div><div class="form-head"><div class="eyebrow">NEW BLOOD DRIVE</div><h1>Create a mobilisation workspace.</h1><p>Add only the administrative information needed to organise the drive.</p></div><% if (error) { %><div class="form-error"><%= error %></div><% } %><form method="post" action="/drives"><div class="form-grid"><label>Drive name<input name="name" required></label><label>Target donor count<input type="number" name="targetCount" min="1" required></label><label>Date & time<input type="datetime-local" name="date" required></label><label>Venue<input name="venue" required></label><label class="full">Official screening information link<input name="screeningLink" placeholder="https://.../screening-information"></label><label class="full">Description<textarea name="description" rows="4" placeholder="Drive details, instructions and mobilisation notes..."></textarea></label></div><div class="form-note">Medical eligibility, clinical screening and blood collection remain with authorised medical professionals and institutions.</div><div class="form-actions"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/dashboard">Cancel</a><button class="btn btn-primary">Create drive →</button></div></form></main><script src="/js/pulsereach-assistant.js?v=1"></script></body></html>
